    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eallum Cristenum mannum gebyrað swiþe rihte, þæt hig haligdom ⁊ hadas ⁊ gehalgode Godes hus æfre swiþe georne griðian ⁊ friðian, ⁊ þæt hi hada gewhylcne weorðian be mæðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It very justly befits all Christian men to maintain very zealously at all times the security and sanctity of holy things and of the members of the clergy, and of the consecrated houses of God, and to honour each member of the clergy according to his rank.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eallum Cristenum mannum gebyrað swiþe rihte, þæt hig haligdom ⁊ hadas ⁊ gehalgode Godes hus æfre swiþe georne griðian ⁊ friðian, ⁊ þæt hi hada gewhylcne weorðian be mæðe.</ab>
      </div>
